    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies how {@link SeekableInMemoryByteChannel} handles positions that lie outside the data actually stored in the channel. <p>The contract under test is:</p> <ul> <li>A position past the end of the data is accepted; reading from there simply returns -1 (end of stream).</li> <li>A position beyond {@link Integer#MAX_VALUE} is also accepted, reads still return -1, but any write from there fails with an {@link IOException}.</li> <li>A negative position is the only value rejected up front, with an {@link IllegalArgumentException}.</li> </ul>"
   },
